<title>USA: Premier Ventures acquires furniture maker.</title>
<headline>Premier Ventures acquires furniture maker.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Ventures and Exploration Inc on Wednesday said it has acquired furniture maker New Directions Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Its product line consists mainly of high end home oak furniture, primarily entertainment and wall units and juvenile furniture, the company said. It generated $5.8 million in sales for the fiscal year ending June 30, 1996.</p>
